  "2026-10-05T15:10:14.038Z","harness:codex","Fresh Greptile CLI review 2c33cca2-a807-4615-8032-89ab612f177d at 15191ebaa reports P1: update -b -h can overwrite body because value_name is incomplete; create/update linked file/test/doc options share the gap. Reuse this canonical help-discovery owner, preserve its prior verified contracts and history, and extend the existing primary SDK/real CLI suite with isolated red-before-green proof. Only this item is being reopened and actively claimed; the other seven implementation owners remain closed. No new item or second PR."
